  "prefLabel": "Jus 808.01 Role of Agency Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 808.01 Role of Agency Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings. Unless called as witnesses, agency staff shall have no role in any enforcement or disciplinary hearing.\n\nSource. #7129, eff 5-3-00",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus800.html"
